    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "(Henderson 1977a). With this structure, all residual effects are again uncorrelated with common variance $ \\sigma_{E}^{2} = (1 - r)\\sigma_{y}^{2} $.",
      "source_page": 782,
      "printed_page": 762,
      "source_block_ids": [
