    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Suppose a total of k measurements are made on n individuals (such a balanced design is not essential). We can write this in the general mixed-model framework as",
      "source_page": 782,
      "printed_page": 762,
      "source_block_ids": [
